				margin: 0 10rpx;
				color: #fff;
				font-size: 28rpx;
				font-weight: bold;
			}
		}
		.payInfo-subBox{
			margin-top: 10rpx;
			flex-direction: row;
			.subBox-price{
				font-weight: bold;
				font-size: 14rpx;
				color: #FF3131;
			}
			.subBox-sub_title{
				margin-left: 8rpx;
				font-size: 14rpx;
				color: #fff
			}
		}
		.payInfo-tips{
			margin-top: 10rpx;
			font-size: 9rpx;
